      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the requested file, I need to choose a concrete external provider for extracting table cells and row structure from a document. Amazon Textract is a suitable choice for this task as it provides robust document text extraction capabilities, including table extraction. I will use the Amazon Textract SDK to identify the provider in the code. </thinking>\n",
